  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "INSTALL MISSING DEPS: npm install framer-motion react-icons lucide-react",
    "Tailwind v3 is installed. Do NOT use v4 specific syntax like @theme.",
    "Use 'Playfair Display' for all Headings (H1-H4) and 'DM Sans' for body.",
    "For the 'Explore' section, create a BENTO GRID layout (mix of col-span-1, col-span-2, row-span-2).",
    "Hero Section MUST use the provided 'Aerial view' image as a background if video fails. Overlay it with a dark gradient for text readability.",
    "Hotels section should use 'Glassmorphism' cards with high-quality images.",
    "Ensure Dark/Light mode toggle works and persists state.",
    "Use Framer Motion for 'staggerChildren' effects on grids and 'fadeInUp' for sections."
  ]
}

